0006    | OP_DEFINE_GLOBAL    2 'Point'
0008    | OP_GET_GLOBAL       2 'Point'
0010    2 OP_NIL
0011    | OP_FIELD            3 'x' public mutable
0015    3 OP_NIL
0016    | OP_FIELD            4 'y' public mutable
